# Local MCP client wiring for whichever agent tooling a developer runs; not part of
# RepoForge and not reviewed configuration. Swept in once by a careless `git add -A`.
.mcp.json

# Scratch space for ad-hoc runner scripts. Gitignored on purpose: the workspace
# fingerprint is built from `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard`, so anything
# here is invisible to it and cannot reach a commit or a diff. A script meant to be
# reviewed belongs in the tree instead.
.rf-scratch/

# Local review/plan scratch and review artifacts; never part of a commit.
.omo/
runtime-control-plane-crash-safety.patch
runtime-review-crash-safety.patch
